## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 4.6 Flash
- **Short description:** Zhipu AI's free, high-throughput lightweight serving tier of the GLM-4.6 generation. Positioned as a zero-cost coding, tool-use and general reasoning workhorse with native function calling and structured output.
- **Provider / access:** Zhipu AI API `glm-4.6-flash`, OpenCode Zen `opencode/glm-4.6-flash`. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** GLM-4.6 generation launched 2025-09-30; Flash free tier available 2026; knowledge cutoff early 2026 per API listings.
- **IDs:** `zhipuai/glm-4.6-flash` / `opencode/glm-4.6-flash`
- **Context window:** 131,072 tokens total with up to 16,384 max output per API spec. Family lineage cites ~200K for flagship; Flash-specific verification pending.
- **Modalities:** Text input / text output, tool calling, JSON mode. Curated entry text-only.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Free $0.00 / $0.00 on Z.ai Flash tier.
- **Architecture:** GLM-4.6 generation sparse-MoE lineage. Flagship 357B MoE MIT-open. Flash is distilled/lightweight serving sibling; exact parameters undisclosed.

